* Ampeg SVT preamp, stage 3 of 4: channel 1 from the V1b follower on (SW1, volume 1, V3A, stack 1, V3B) and V4A. V1A's plate (stage 1) arrives
* through VL0 at p1, where the follower reads it. See preamp.net for how the netlist is split.

.nodes x rb rd p1 kb1 n1 jx jk jka jm vt1 wv1 uh1 p3 k3 a1 bb1 w51 d1 t61 w61 b61 g3b p3b k3b m3 g4 p4a k4a

V VRAIL x 190.0 430
R R47 x rb 15.584k
C C23 rb 0 21.05u
R RDEC rb rd 10.044k
C CDEC rd 0 18.72u

S VL0 p1 1 0
G GB1 kb1 p1 0 1.8m
R RB1 kb1 0 550
C C2 kb1 n1 100n
* SW1: direct / bass cut / ultra low.
R SW_DIR n1 vt1 1
R R8 n1 jx 150k
C C3 n1 jx 2n
R R9 jx vt1 150k
C C4 n1 jk 2n
C C5 jk vt1 2n
R SW_KA jk jka 1e12
R R10 jka jm 820k
R SW_RB jka jm 1e12
R R11 jm 0 68k
* Volume 1 (1M lin) and Ultra Hi (500p across its top section).
R VR_V1T vt1 wv1 1
R VR_V1B wv1 0 1
R SW_UH1 vt1 uh1 1e12
C C6 uh1 wv1 500p
* V3a (47k load, 4k7 cathode), 0.1u into the stack.
T V3A wv1 p3 k3 12AX7
R R24 rd p3 47k
R R25 k3 0 4k7
C C7 p3 a1 100n
* Stack 1.
R R220A a1 bb1 220k
R VR_BS1T bb1 w51 1
R VR_BS1B w51 d1 1
C C001A bb1 w51 1n
C C01A w51 d1 10n
R R22KA d1 0 22k
C C47PA a1 t61 470p
R VR_TR1T t61 w61 1
R VR_TR1B w61 b61 1
C C47NA b61 0 4n7
R R26 w51 w61 120k
* V3b (220k load, 560 + 7k5 cathode, 1M grid return to the cathode divider), 0.1... 10n into V4a.
C C14 t61 g3b 10n
T V3B g3b p3b k3b 12AX7
R R28 rd p3b 220k
R R29 k3b m3 560
R R30 m3 0 7k5
R R27 g3b m3 1M
C C15 p3b g4 10n
R R31 g4 0 1M

T V4A g4 p4a k4a 12AX7
R R32 rb p4a 470k
R R33 k4a 0 3k3
